WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.770
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.070
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.370
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.610
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.430
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为你制作了这档终极《办公室》重温播客。

6
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:19.410
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会深度解析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:20.590
We're The Office ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

8
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.540
If you have a daughter, you can take her to work today.
如果你有女儿，今天可以带她去上班。

9
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:28.220
Yes.
没错。

10
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.660
It's take your daughter to work day.
今天是带女儿上班日。

11
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.040
To Dunder Mifflin.
去邓德·米夫林公司。

12
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.920
Season 2, episode 18.
第二季，第十八集。

13
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.460
This one's written by Mindy Kaling and directed by Victor Nellie Jr.
这一集由敏迪·卡灵编剧，维克多·内利二世执导。

14
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:38.900
Victor Nellie.
维克多·内利。

15
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:39.960
Second one he's directed.
这是他执导的第二集。

16
00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:40.480
Yes.
是的。

17
00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.720
Prolific TV director.
多产的电视导演。

18
00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:42.480
He's fantastic.
他太棒了。

19
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:43.660
We really liked him.
我们真的很喜欢他。

20
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.560
He was so nice.
他非常友善。

21
00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.100
Should I start with a summary?
我要从剧情梗概开始吗？

22
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.860
Jenna, you know that's how you start.
珍娜，你知道这就是你的开场方式。

23
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:49.500
I know.
我知道。

24
00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:50.180
Just do it.
直接开始吧。

25
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.180
I should just do it in order.
我应该按部就班地来。

26
00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.960
I like every week, though, that you ask me.
不过我喜欢你每周都问我一遍。

27
00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.340
Every week, you're like, should I start with a summary?
每周你都会问，我要从剧情梗概开始吗？

28
00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.740
Like, what if I was like, no, not today, lady?
要是哪天我说，不，今天不行呢？

29
00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.000
What would I do?
你会怎么办？

30
00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:02.660
I don't know.
我不知道。

31
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.120
Would I listen to you or would I just do it anyway?
你是会听我的，还是会自顾自地开始？

32
00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.620
You'd probably be deer in headlights.
你大概会像受惊的鹿一样不知所措。

33
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:07.320
You know what?
你知道吗？

34
00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.580
Try it some week and we'll see.
哪周试试看，我们就知道了。

35
00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.120
Okay, I will.
好吧，我会的。

36
00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:09.820
But not this week.
但不是这周。

37
00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:10.740
You told me to do it.
你刚才让我开始的。

38
00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.180
Do it.
开始吧。

39
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:11.800
Here I go.
那我开始了。

40
00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:16.620
In this episode, the Dunder Mifflin employees bring their daughters to work for the day.
在这一集中，邓德·米夫林的员工们带着他们的女儿来公司上班。

41
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Stanley brings his teenage daughter, who starts crushing on Ryan.
斯坦利带了他十几岁的女儿，她开始迷恋瑞安。

42
00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:24.740
I mean, she's just a version of Mindy, right?
我是说，她简直就是敏迪的翻版，对吧？

43
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:25.500
A little bit.
有一点。

44
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.100
A little bit.
有一点。

45
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.280
What is it about Ryan?
瑞安到底有什么魅力？

46
00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.040
The ladies love Ryan.
女士们都爱瑞安。

47
00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:29.580
I know.
我知道。

48
00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.440
Kevin brings his fiance's daughter.
凯文带了他未婚妻的女儿。

49
00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.080
Right.
没错。

50
00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:39.100
Meredith brings her son and Toby brings his kind of shy five-year-old daughter, who ends
梅雷迪斯带了她的儿子，托比带了他有点害羞的五岁女儿，最后

51
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.460
up bonding with Michael.
和迈克尔建立感情。

52
00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:46.160
Also in this episode, Pam makes it her mission to befriend just one kid.
这一集中，帕姆的任务是至少要和一个孩子交上朋友。

53
00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.400
Just one.
就一个。

54
00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:47.840
Yeah.
没错。

55
00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.700
We learned that Pam is not good with kids.
我们了解到帕姆不太擅长应付孩子。

56
00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:50.720
Apparently not.
显然是不擅长。

57
00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:51.680
All right.
好吧。

58
00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.420
Should we do our fast facts?
我们要开始讲快问快答了吗？

59
00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.240
Why are you asking me?
你为什么要问我？

60
00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:56.860
Because that's part of it.
因为那是流程的一部分。

61
00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:57.320
Yes.
是的。

62
00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:57.800
Do them.
讲吧。

63
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:01.440
Part of doing the fast facts is me asking you if I should do the fast facts.
快问快答流程的一部分就是我得问你我该不该讲快问快答。

64
00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.900
Jenna, you should do your fast facts.
珍娜，你应该讲你的快问快答了。

65
00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:03.030
All right.
好吧。

66
00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:08.680
Fast fact number one, we got a lot of questions about the kids in this episode.
快问快答第一条，我们收到了很多关于这一集中孩子的问题。

67
00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.260
So let's break them down one by one.
所以我们来逐一解答吧。

68
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.420
Stanley's daughter, Melissa, was played by Jazz Rae Cole.
斯坦利的女儿梅丽莎是由爵士·雷·科尔饰演的。

69
00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:15.980
Okay.
好的。

70
00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.300
And she is a professional actress.
她是一位专业演员。

71
00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.360
No relation to anyone on the show.
和剧组里的任何人都没有亲戚关系。

72
00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.480
We hired her.
是我们雇佣她的。

73
00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:24.200
She was also on the sitcom My Wife and Kids.
她还出演过情景喜剧《我的老婆和孩子》。

74
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.620
When she shot this episode, she was 17 or 18 years old.
拍这一集的时候，她大概17或18岁。

75
00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:32.440
So her birthday is in February.
她的生日是在二月。

76
00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.680
And I think that's right around the time we were shooting.
我想那正好是我们拍摄的时候。

77
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:38.860
And I have this memory of her telling me that she had just turned 18.
我记得她当时告诉我她刚满18岁。

78
00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:39.420
Aw.
噢。

79
00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:46.440
When I first came to Los Angeles, I was in my 20s, but I looked like I was a teenager.
我刚到洛杉矶的时候，虽然已经20多岁了，但看起来还像个青少年。

80
00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.100
Right.
没错。

81
00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:53.580
And so I had this special agent who would send me out for roles to play high school kids
所以我有个专门的经纪人，他会派我去试镜高中生的角色，

82
00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:57.980
because when you have a kid on a set, they have very limited work hours.
因为当片场有孩子时，他们的工作时间非常有限。

83
00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:01.960
They have child hours, according to the union rules.
根据工会规定，他们有儿童工作时长限制。

84
00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.500
And so they can't work as long of days.
所以他们不能工作太长时间。

85
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.720
They have to take these breaks.
他们必须休息。

86
00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:08.920
There has to be a tutor who teaches them school stuff.
还得有专门的导师给他们补习功课。

87
00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:15.540
So if you look older than 18, but you can play a kid, this is like a little niche market.
所以如果你看起来超过18岁，但又能演孩子，这算是一个小众市场。

88
00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.120
I was in 90210.
我演过《飞越比佛利》。

89
00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.100
Oh, my gosh, Angela.
天哪，安吉拉。

90
00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.120
No, you were not.
不，你没有。

91
00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.040
I was in 90210, and I didn't have lines.
我演过《飞越比佛利》，而且我没有台词。

92
00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:27.140
My biggest moment, though, was when I played Tori Spelling's sorority sister.
不过我最高光的时刻是饰演托莉·斯佩林的姐妹会成员。

93
00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:27.780
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

94
00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.460
And we were collecting votes.
当时我们在收集选票。

95
00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.860
I think they were going to vote some girl out of the sorority.
我想她们是要投票把某个女孩踢出姐妹会。

96
00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.620
And I collected the votes, and I had to hand them to Tori.
我收集了选票，然后必须把它们交给托莉。

97
00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:36.620
Whoa.
哇。

98
00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:37.840
Yes.
是的。

99
00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.080
So I remember.
所以我记得。

100
00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:45.000
I remember it like it was kind of cool if you could get parts like that because you could work longer hours,
我记得当时觉得能接到那样的角色挺酷的，因为你可以工作更长时间，

101
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.320
and you were older, playing younger.
而且你当时年纪更大，却在演一个更年轻的角色。

102
00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:52.000
I got to be in the movie Pleasantville with Tobey Maguire and Reese Witherspoon.
我有幸参演了电影《欢乐谷》，和托比·马奎尔以及瑞茜·威瑟斯彭一起。

103
00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.020
That's a good one.
那部电影很棒。

104
00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:53.400
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

105
00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.120
And I got to work a whole week, which is really exciting.
我能在那儿工作整整一周，这真的太令人兴奋了。

106
00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.680
I was just a featured extra.
我当时只是个特约群演。

107
00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:58.400
Me, too.
我也是。

108
00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.800
When I was the sorority sister, I was the featured extra.
我演那个联谊会姐妹的时候，也是特约群演。

109
00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:01.200
Yes.
没错。

110
00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:05.540
I was a featured extra in Pleasantville because I was over 18 to play under.
我在《欢乐谷》里是特约群演，因为我当时超过18岁了，却要演一个未成年人。

111
00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.320
Yeah.
是啊。

112
00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:07.600
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

113
00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.160
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

114
00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:13.940
And Toby's daughter, Sasha, was played by Delaney Ruth Farrell.
托比的女儿萨莎是由德莱尼·露丝·法雷尔饰演的。

115
00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:16.540
Now, here's a little interesting tidbit about her.
现在，关于她有一个有趣的小花絮。

116
00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:16.900
What?
什么？

117
00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.340
She was the daughter of our set dresser, Sean Farrell.
她是我们的布景师肖恩·法雷尔的女儿。

118
00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:20.740
Aw.
噢。

119
00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:28.420
So you maybe remember we had an establishing shot of Toby's desk a while ago where he explains that he's divorced and he has a daughter.
所以你们可能还记得，之前我们有一个托比办公桌的空镜头，他在那儿解释说他离婚了，还有一个女儿。

120
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.600
And there is a picture of a little blonde girl.
桌上有一张小金发女孩的照片。

121
00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.220
He says this is Sasha.
他说这就是萨莎。

122
00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:36.760
That picture was placed there by Sean of his daughter.
那张照片是肖恩放上去的，照片里就是他女儿。

123
00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:42.160
So when it came time to do this episode, we kind of had to use her.
所以到了拍这一集的时候，我们理所当然得用她。

124
00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:42.680
Wait.
等等。

125
00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:47.060
So did Sean just sort of make that happen?
所以是肖恩促成了这件事吗？

126
00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:47.460
Yeah.
没错。

127
00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.540
Sean just put a picture of his daughter on Toby's desk.
肖恩只是把女儿的照片放到了托比的桌子上。

128
00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.680
Well, she's very cute.
嗯，她非常可爱。

129
00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:52.600
So cute.
太可爱了。

130
00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.960
And she was so good.
而且她表现得非常好。

131
00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:54.840
She did great.
她演得很棒。

132
00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:55.780
Not an actress.
她不是演员。

133
00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.360
Just daughter of our set dresser.
只是我们布景师的女儿。

134
00:04:59.060 --> 00:04:59.420
Yeah.
是啊。

135
00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.520
And she's going to come back again in Family Portrait Day.
而且她还会再回来参加《全家福日》那集。

136
00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:03.460
Okay.
好的。

137
00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.880
So now Meredith's son.
那么现在是梅雷迪思的儿子。

138
00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:06.560
Meredith's son is hard to say.
“梅雷迪思的儿子”这几个字很难说。

139
00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:07.460
Meredith's son.
梅雷迪思的儿子。

140
00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.980
You guys, Jenna has tried it three times.
伙计们，珍娜已经试了三次了。

141
00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:09.380
I have.
我确实试了。

142
00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:14.560
Meredith's son, Jake Palmer, was played by Spencer Daniels.
梅雷迪思的儿子杰克·帕尔默是由斯宾塞·丹尼尔斯饰演的。

143
00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.140
No relation to Greg Daniels.
和格雷格·丹尼尔斯没有亲戚关系。

144
00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:17.560
Nope.
没有。

145
00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.520
Wikipedia, you're wrong.
维基百科，你错了。

146
00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:20.100
Okay.
好的。

147
00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:21.240
Did you hear us?
你听到我们说的了吗？

148
00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:21.680
Fix it.
去改掉它。

149
00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:22.040
Okay.
好的。

150
00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.860
Maybe that was somewhere else.
也许那是别的地方写的。

151
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:24.460
I read that.
我读过那个。

152
00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:25.160
Dunderpedia.
邓德百科。

153
00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.120
Maybe it was Dunder.
也许是邓德。

154
00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.720
One of the pedias is saying that Spencer Daniels is Greg Daniels' son.
其中一个百科说斯宾塞·丹尼尔斯是格雷格·丹尼尔斯的儿子。

155
00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:30.300
He is not.
他不是。

156
00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:30.940
Not the case.
事实并非如此。

157
00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:36.560
Now, Spencer is also going to come back in Season 8, Episode 24, Family Portrait Day.
现在，斯宾塞还要在第八季第24集《全家福日》中回归。

158
00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:43.880
Fan question from curly-haired Tess and Hannah Bursell and Lisa Farr and many others.
来自卷发泰丝、汉娜·伯塞尔、丽莎·法尔以及许多其他人的粉丝提问。

159
00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:50.180
Was Meredith's son played by the same actor when he came back as the stripper for Angela's
梅雷迪思的儿子在第九季安吉拉的单身派对上以脱衣舞男的身份回归时，

160
00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.080
Bachelorette Party in Season 9?
是由同一个演员扮演的吗？

161
00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:56.360
We'll get there, but that's one of the most uncomfortable moments of my life.
我们会讲到那里的，但那是我人生中最尴尬的时刻之一。

162
00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:57.440
Yes.
是的。

163
00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:58.420
It's the same actor.
是同一个演员。

164
00:05:59.060 --> 00:05:59.500
Yes.
是的。

165
00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:00.480
Oh, God.
天哪。

166
00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:03.360
Yes.
是的。

167
